//RS //! Structural sub-parsers for the `deps:`, `packages:`, `boundaries:`, `build:`,
//RS //! `authority:`, and `policy:` blocks of the ratified `package.jet`
//RS //! vocabulary
//RS //! (D-CONF-PLANE1, D-CONF-NAME1). These blocks carry semantics ratified by
//RS //! their own, separate decisions (D-JPK23, D-TGT1/D-TGT2/D-TGT3, D-CFFI2,
//RS //! D-BUILDPROFILE1, D-CTEFFECT1, D-EFFBUDGET1, D-AUTHORITY-MANIFEST1,
//RS //! D-BOUND-PROV1, D-JPK-GRANTSCHEMA1, D-JPK-PROVIDERAUTH1, D-LINTPOLICY1,
//RS //! D-PACKAGE-POLICY-SCOPE1,
//RS //! D-ONCE-AUTODERIVE1) — this module is the single reader for all of them, so
//RS //! `package.jet` never again has two parsers for one fact.
//RS 
